      "post_id": "15071",
      "author_handle": "kaceyh29",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "I've been to Legoland, well not just *me* that would be sad, we took Harry and the twins for Harry's birthday two years ago.\nThe twins were babies and I thought it would be really difficult with double buggy and double stuff but it was very good there for little ones.  Lots of eateries scattered about and baby changing / toilets were all over the place.  Queuing wasn't bad either but we did go midweek during summer hols.\nThere is lots to do there and to see it properly two days would be great, we only had the day there.\nKerry X",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-1621/#15071",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/8be637feea463cd98776.html",
