      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 11 months ago",
      "body": "Wow, I went and had an ok time, my boy was six and was too young and got scared on many of the rides. The queue's where horrendous and we queued 45 min for a boat ride that lasted 10 min!! The food was rubbish and so expensive. But they had nice areas to sit and relax and the models where excellent! Loads to do. Have a nice time.",
